Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi everyone! Today I'm presenting IncidentLens,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,an evidence-driven multi-agent system for\Nsoftware incident root cause analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In production postmortems, the most dangerous\Nfailure mode isn't failing to find an answer —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it's hallucinating a plausible\Nstory. Generic LLM agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,routinely assert confident root\Ncauses without valid citations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,ignore data access boundaries, and almost\Nnever admit when evidence is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,IncidentLens enforces a much\Nstricter engineering contract:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,every claim must cite an\Nactually observed evidence ID,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,every agent operates inside\Nexplicit read-only tool permissions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and when visible telemetry cannot\Nuniquely identify the root cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the system must abstain with\NINCONCLUSIVE rather than guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the next nine minutes,\NI'll walk through the architecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,show you four live hands-on demos,\Nand share our full-scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,cross-model experimental findings\Nacross DeepSeek and Tencent Hunyuan.
